# Solvation shell: CREST grows a cluster; xTB and DFT refine the cluster.
recipe: solvation-shell
title: Solvation shell
field: Conformations
summary: xTB optimisation, CREST solvation shell (QCG), then xTB and DFT optimisation and frequencies of the cluster
description: xTB optimises the solute first because CREST needs an optimised geometry, CREST grows a shell of solvent molecules around the solute (water, ten molecules, one cluster; set in the CREST box), xTB re-optimises the cluster and a DFT optimisation with frequencies refines it. The Solvent row sets the implicit solvent of the xTB and DFT steps and, when CREST can build it (water, methanol, acetonitrile), the solvent molecule of the shell; it starts at water. The energies are those of the whole cluster.
role: dft | DFT optimisation and frequencies | B3LYP | 6-31+G(d) | the usual starting level; diffuse functions when the molecule is an anion
role: solvent | Solvent | | water | the shell's solvent molecule, also used as the implicit solvent
rules: anion-diffuse, heavy-ecp, size, registered

variant: orca | CREST, xTB, ORCA | ORCA
step: orca | preopt | xtb | | Geometry | xTB Opt | structure
step: orca | crest | CREST | | Solvation Shell | solvation shell |
link: orca | preopt | crest | geometry
set: orca | crest | ES.Runtype.QCG.Solvent | water
set: orca | crest | ES.Runtype.QCG.Number | 10
step: orca | xtb | xtb | | GeoVib | xTB Opt + Freq | 
step: orca | dft | ORCA | dft | GeoVib | DFT Opt + Freq | key=final, thermo
link: orca | crest | xtb | geometry
link: orca | xtb | dft | geometry

variant: g16 | CREST, xTB, Gaussian 16 | G16
step: g16 | preopt | xtb | | Geometry | xTB Opt | structure
step: g16 | crest | CREST | | Solvation Shell | solvation shell |
link: g16 | preopt | crest | geometry
set: g16 | crest | ES.Runtype.QCG.Solvent | water
set: g16 | crest | ES.Runtype.QCG.Number | 10
step: g16 | xtb | xtb | | GeoVib | xTB Opt + Freq | 
step: g16 | dft | G16 | dft | GeoVib | DFT Opt + Freq | key=final, thermo
